    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezekieli okoirwa Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase omwaka bw’emerongo ebere, na etano, bw’okong’anyigwa gwaito, ase omochakano bw’omwaka, ase rituko ria ikomi ri’omotienyi, ase omwaka o ikomi na kane magega omochie kobuirwe, ee, ase rituko riria riria okoboko kw’Omonene gokaba igoro y’ane gokang’ira aaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ase okorora naetwe na Nyasae, ere akang’ira gochia ase ense y’Abaisraeli, akambeka igoro ase egetunwa egetambe mono. Aroro agwo ’nkarora egento kenga oboagacho bw’omochie ore ensemo ya Irianyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akang’ira aase agwo, nkarora omonto, na okororekana kwaye nigo kwarenge buna ogw’etai; omonto oyio nigo abwate engori y’egatani na emoti y’okorengera ase okoboko kwaye; ere nigo ateneine ang’e negeita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria aganteebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, rigereria orore namaiso ao, na otegerere oigwe namato ao, naende orengererie mono igoro y’aya onsi ngochia gokworokia, ekiagera aye nigo kwarentirwe aase aiga, erinde nkworokie amang’ana ayio. Amang’ana ayio onsi orarore, oyateebie Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egeita kia moocha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkarora orwaki rwaetanaine eraaro y’enyomba eria chinsemo chionsi. Emoti yarenge ase okoboko kw’omonto oria nigo yarenge nobotambe bw’amaboko atano na rimo, na kera ekerengo gi’okoboko gekamentwa eki’egesanyi ekemo. Omonto oria akarengia",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "orwaki. Obogare bwaye bokaba emoti eyemo, na obotambe bwaye gochia igoro emoti eyemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akagenda ase egeita kiarochie moocha, akariinera ebiriinero biaye. Erio akarengia obogare bw’egesona inse agwo ase oboagacho bw’egeita, bokaba emoti eyemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinyomba bi’oborendi mbiarengeo, kera akamo nigo karenge nobotambe bw’emoti eyemo, na obogare bw’emoti eyemo boigo. Ribaga eriarenge gati‐gati y’ebinyomba ebio nigo riarenge ri’obotambe bw’amaboko atano, na ekerengo ki’egesona ki’oboagacho bw’egeita nigo kiarenge eki’emoti eyemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo akarengia ensemo y’egesona ime, nero ekaba ey’ekerengo ki’emoti eyemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo akarengia obogare bw’egesona keria, borobwo bokaba obw’ekerengo ki’amaboko atano na atato, ne chisiiro chiaye nigo chiarenge echi’ekerengo ki’amaboko abere. Egesona keria nigo kiarochie ase enyomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboagacho obwo bw’egeita kia moocha nigo bwarenge nebinyomba bi’oborendi, bitato ensemo eyemo, na bitato ensemo ende; bionsi nigo biarenge nekerengo ekemo, ne chisiiro chie chinsemo chionsi ibere nigo chiarenge echi’ekerengo ekemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akarengia obogare bw’egeita kia ime, naborobwo bokaba obw’ekerengo ki’amaboko ikomi, na obotambe bw’egesoero bokaba obw’amaboko ikomi na atato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orosenge ndwarenge bosio bw’ebinyomba biria bi’oborendi, na obogare bw’egesona keria nigo bwarenge obw’okoboko okomo. Ebisona bi’ebinyomba ebio bie chinsemo chionsi ibere nigo biareng’aine. Kera akanyomba nigo karenge nobogare bw’ekerengo ki’amaboko atano na rimo, na obotambe bwaye boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akarengia obotambe korwa ase akanyomba akamo goika ase akande karenge ensemo ende y’egesoero. Obotambe obwo bokaba obw’amaboko emerongo ebere na atano. Ebisieri bi’ebinyomba ebio nigo biachikaine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarenga chindwaro chie chisiiro chiarenge ase chinsemo ibere ime y’egesoero, na obotambe obwo nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko emerongo etano nomo, na isiko goetanana chisiiro echio amabaga narengeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obotambe korwa ase oboagacho bw’egeita gia isiko gochia ase obw’egeita kia ime nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko emerongo etano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebibao biasiekeire ebitange nigo biarenge ase chinyasi chi’ebinyomba biria bi’oborendi, na ase emetobwa yabo, ne chinsemo chionsi chi’oboagacho obwo, ne chisiiro nigo chiachabeire nemegwekano y’emekendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eraaro ya isiko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria akang’ira goika ase eraaro ya isiko yatichire inse namagena ase chinsemo chionsi, na aroro agwo ’nkarora ebinyomba emerongo etato biaagachire igoro y’amagena ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obogare bw’aase aria atichire nigo bwareng’aine nobwe rikere ri’amaagacho are biita. Aase aria atichire nigo arenge aase are inse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akarengia obotambe korwa ase oboagacho bw’egeita gia inse gochia ase obw’egeita ki’eraaro ya ime, naborobwo bokaba obw’amaboko rigana erimo. Ekerengo gi’enseemo ya moocha na eya sugusu nigo biareng’aine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egeita gia sugusu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akagenda ase oboagacho bware geita ki’eraaro ya isiko kiarochie sugusu, na akarengia obotambe na obogare bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinyomba bi’oborendi ebiarenge ime y’oboagacho boria, bitato ase ensemo eyemo, na bitato ase ensemo ende, ne chisiiro, na egesona, nigo biareng’aine nebi’oboagacho bware geita kie ritang’ani. Obotambe bw’oboagacho boria nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko emerongo etano, na obogare bwaye nobw’amaboko emerongo ebere na atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebibao biaye, na egesoero kiaye, na emegwekano eria y’emekendo, bionsi ebio nigo biareng’aine na biria bi’oboagacho bware geita kiarochie moocha. Ekeriinero kiare n’ebitambokero bitano na bibere nkiarengeo kiare koriinerwa gochiao, na egesona kiaye nigo kiarenge ime y’oboagacho obwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kororia ase oboagacho obwo bwa geita gia sugusu, oboagacho bonde mbwarengeo bw’egeita kiare gosoerwa gochia ase eraaro ya ime. Obwo nabwo bwareng’aine noboagacho bw’egeita kiarochie moocha. Akarenga obotambe korwa ase oboagacho bonde goika ase obonde, bokaba obw’amaboko rigana erimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egeita kia Irianyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria akang’ira gochia ase ensemo ya Irianyi, na aroro nkarora oboagacho bware geita. Akarengia chisiiro chiaye na egesoero kiaye, na ebirengo ebio nigo biarenge buna ebi’ebinde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebibao nigo biarenge ase oboagacho obwo ase chinsemo chionsi, na ase egesona kiaye, nabirobio nigo biareng’aine nebinde. Obotambe bw’oboagacho boria nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko emerongo etano, na obogare bwaye obw’amaboko emerongo ebere na atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekeriinero kiarenge n’ebitangora bitano na bibere nkiarengeo kiare koriinerwa gochiao; egesona kiaye nigo kiarenge ime y’oboagacho obwo. Emegwekano y’emekendo nigo yachabeire ase chisiiro chiaye chiarenge ase chinsemo ibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo ase ensemo ya Irianyi oboagacho mbwarengeo bware negeita kegosoerwa goika ase eraaro ya ime. Akarenga obotambe korwa ase oboagacho bonde goika ase obonde, bokaba obw’amaboko rigana erimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Egeita kia Irianyi ki’eraaro ya ime",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria akang’ira ase eraaro ya ime goetera ase oboagacho bware geita ase ensemo ya Irianyi, akaborengia, naborobwo nigo bwareng’aine nayande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinyomba biaye bi’oborendi, ne chisiiro, na egesona, nigo biareng’aine nebi’amaagacho ande. Boigo ebibao mbiarengeo ase chinsemo chiaye chionsi, na ase egesona. Obotambe bw’oboagacho boria nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko emerongo etano, na obogare bwaye obw’amaboko emerongo ebere na atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisona nigo biarenge ase chinsemo chionsi; obotambe bwabo nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko emerongo ebere na atano, na obogare bwabo obw’amaboko atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egesona kiaye kiarochie ase eraaro ya isiko, na emegwekano y’emekendo nigo yachabeire ase chisiiro chiaye, na ekeriinero kiaye nigo kiarenge nebitangora bitano na bitato biare koriinerwa gochiao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
