        {
          "text": "Egeita gia sugusu ki’eraaro ya ime",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akang’ira ase oboagacho bware geita ase ensemo ya sugusu, akaborengia; naborobwo nigo bwareng’aine nayande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinyomba biaye bi’oborendi, ne chisiiro, na egesona, nigo biareng’aine nebi’amaagacho ande. Ebibao nigo biarenge ase chinsemo chiaye chionsi. Obotambe bw’oboagacho boria nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko emerongo etano, na obogare bwaye obw’amaboko emerongo ebere na atano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisiiro chiaye nigo chiarochie ase eraaro ya isiko, na emegwekano y’emekendo nigo yachabeire ase chisiiro chiria chiarenge ase chinsemo ibere, na ekeriinero kiaye nigo kiarenge n’ebitangora bitano na bitato biare koriinerwa gochiao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amaagacho arenge ang’e negeita gia sugusu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebinyomba mbiarengeo amo nebisieri biabo ang’e ne chisiiro agwo ase amaagacho onsi arenge nebiita; agwo nao ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa biarenge gosiberigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo ase rikere ri’oboagacho obwo ime, chimesa ibere nchiarengeo ase kera ensemo. Igoro ase chimesa echio nao ching’iti chi’ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa, na ebi’ebibe, na ebi’okomocha, biarenge konyenyerwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende chimesa chinde ibere nchiarenge agwo isiko ase baare gotiirera gochia ase egeita kia ime ki’oboagacho bwarochie sugusu; boigo ase ensemo ende y’egesoero ekio nchiarengeo chimesa chinde ibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimesa echio chionsi ase ebing’wanso biarenge konyenyerwa nigo chiarenge isano na isato, inye nigo chiarenge ase rikere erimo ri’oboagacho, na inye ase rikere rinde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende nchiarengeo chimesa inye ase ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa chiaroisirie korwa ase amagena abaachire. Igoro yabo nao ebinto biarenge gokorerwa emeremo ase ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa, na ebing’wanso binde, biarenge kogachwa. Obotambe bwa kera emesa nigo bwarenge obw’okoboko okomo na ekeng’ese, na obogare bw’okoboko okomo na ekeng’ese boigo, na obotambe gochia igoro nigo bwarenge obw’okoboko okomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase chinsinyo chia kera emesa ase chinsemo chiaye chionsi, ebigobanio mbiarengeo; obotambe bwa kera ekemo nigo bwarenge buna obogare bw’egesanyi gi’okoboko; na igoro ye chimesa echio nao chinyama chi’ebing’wanso chiarenge kobekererwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiko y’oboagacho bw’egeita kia ime gochia ase eraaro ya ime, ebinyomba bibere bi’abateri mbiarengeo, akamo kaare ang’e negeita gia sugusu karochie Irianyi, na akande ensemo y’egeita kia moocha karochie sugusu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria aganteebia, Akanyomba aka karochie Irianyi nak’abakuani bagokora emeremo ase Hekalu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na akwo karochie sugusu nak’abakuani bagokora emeremo ase egesasiimero. Aba nab’ororeria rwa Zadoki, abwo boka korwa ase ororeria rwa Lawi bancheire gocha ang’e ase Omonene komokorera emeremo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eraaro ya ime na oboagacho bwe Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende omonto oria akarengia eraaro ya ime; obotambe bwaye nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko rigana erimo, na obogare bwaye boigo; egesasiimero nigo kiarenge bosio bwe Hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akang’ira ase egesona gie Hekalu, akarengia emetobwa yabekireo, na kera oyomo okaba obogare bw’amaboko atano. Obogare bw’egeita nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko atato ensemo eyemo, na atato ensemo ende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obogare bw’egesona ekio nigo bwarenge obw’amaboko emerongo ebere, na obotambe bwaye gochia ime obw’amaboko ikomi na rimo. Nkiarengeo ekeriinero kiare koriinerwa gochiao. Ase kera ensemo bosio bw’emetobwa eria, chisiiro nchiarengeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
